      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to search",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "Each running-log panel is locked to one service and refreshes every five seconds. Start in **Incident search** when the report begins with an email address, public media token, task ID, delivery UUID, route, operation, service, or time window. Return here for unrestricted LogsQL exploration, then open a matching `trace_id` in **Incident traces**. Raw addresses are redacted before storage."}
